[{"title":"My Morning (הבוקר שלי)","text":"I wake up at seven. I drink water and eat bread with cheese. Then I go to work by bus. The bus is often full, but I like to look out the window.","glossary":[{"word":"wake up","partOfSpeech":"verb","definition":"להתעורר משינה","example":"I wake up early.","translation":"להתעורר"},{"word":"bus","partOfSpeech":"noun","definition":"כלי תחבורה ציבורי גדול","example":"The bus is full.","translation":"אוטובוס"},{"word":"full","partOfSpeech":"adjective","definition":"מלא, אין מקום פנוי","example":"The cup is full.","translation":"מלא"}],"questions":[{"question":"When does the writer wake up?","options":["At six","At seven","At eight","At nine"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"כתוב 'I wake up at seven'."},{"question":"How does the writer go to work?","options":["By car","By bike","By bus","On foot"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"כתוב 'I go to work by bus'."}]},{"title":"My Friend Lia (החברה שלי ליה)","text":"Lia is my friend. She lives near my house. We go to school together every day. After school we play in the park and then we do our homework.","glossary":[{"word":"near","partOfSpeech":"preposition","definition":"קרוב ל-","example":"I live near the sea.","translation":"ליד/קרוב"},{"word":"together","partOfSpeech":"adverb","definition":"ביחד, עם מישהו","example":"We work together.","translation":"ביחד"},{"word":"homework","partOfSpeech":"noun","definition":"עבודה שעושים בבית אחרי בית הספר","example":"I do my homework.","translation":"שיעורי בית"}],"questions":[{"question":"Where does Lia live?","options":["Far away","Near the writer's house","In another city","At school"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"כתוב 'She lives near my house'."},{"question":"What do they do after school?","options":["Sleep","Play in the park","Go to work","Watch TV"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"כתוב 'we play in the park'."}]},{"title":"The Cat (החתול)","text":"I have a small cat. Her name is Mimi. She is black and white. Mimi sleeps all day and plays at night. I give her food in the morning and in the evening.","glossary":[{"word":"small","partOfSpeech":"adjective","definition":"קטן בגודלו","example":"A small cat.","translation":"קטן"},{"word":"sleep","partOfSpeech":"verb","definition":"לנוח עם עיניים עצומות","example":"I sleep at night.","translation":"לישון"},{"word":"evening","partOfSpeech":"noun","definition":"החלק האחרון של היום","example":"Good evening.","translation":"ערב"}],"questions":[{"question":"What colour is Mimi?","options":["All black","Black and white","Brown","Grey"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"כתוב 'She is black and white'."},{"question":"When does Mimi play?","options":["In the morning","At noon","At night","Never"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"כתוב 'plays at night'."}]},{"title":"At the Shop (בחנות)","text":"On Sunday I go to the shop. I buy milk, eggs and apples. The shop is near my house. The woman at the shop is very nice and she always says hello.","glossary":[{"word":"buy","partOfSpeech":"verb","definition":"לתת כסף ולקבל מוצר","example":"I buy bread.","translation":"לקנות"},{"word":"shop","partOfSpeech":"noun","definition":"מקום שבו קונים דברים","example":"The shop is open.","translation":"חנות"},{"word":"nice","partOfSpeech":"adjective","definition":"נחמד, טוב","example":"She is nice.","translation":"נחמד"}],"questions":[{"question":"What does the writer buy?","options":["Milk, eggs and apples","Bread and cheese","Only milk","Fish"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"כתוב 'milk, eggs and apples'."},{"question":"How is the woman at the shop?","options":["Tired","Angry","Nice","Busy"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"כתוב 'is very nice'."}]},{"title":"My Day Off (יום החופש שלי)","text":"Today I do not work. I stay at home. In the morning I read a book. In the afternoon my brother comes and we cook lunch. It is a good day.","glossary":[{"word":"stay","partOfSpeech":"verb","definition":"להישאר במקום","example":"I stay at home.","translation":"להישאר"},{"word":"cook","partOfSpeech":"verb","definition":"להכין אוכל","example":"We cook dinner.","translation":"לבשל"},{"word":"brother","partOfSpeech":"noun","definition":"אח","example":"My brother is tall.","translation":"אח"}],"questions":[{"question":"Where is the writer today?","options":["At work","At home","At school","At the park"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"כתוב 'I stay at home'."},{"question":"Who comes in the afternoon?","options":["A friend","The teacher","The brother","Nobody"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"כתוב 'my brother comes'."}]},{"title":"At the Park (בפארק)","text":"On Saturday we go to the park. My father plays football with me. My mother sits and reads a book. Later we eat sandwiches on the grass. I like Saturdays.","glossary":[{"word":"park","partOfSpeech":"noun","definition":"שטח ירוק ציבורי","example":"We play in the park.","translation":"פארק"},{"word":"football","partOfSpeech":"noun","definition":"משחק כדור פופולרי","example":"I like football.","translation":"כדורגל"},{"word":"grass","partOfSpeech":"noun","definition":"הצמח הירוק שעל הקרקע","example":"Sit on the grass.","translation":"דשא"}],"questions":[{"question":"What does the father do at the park?","options":["Reads","Plays football","Sleeps","Cooks"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"'plays football with me'."},{"question":"Where do they eat?","options":["At home","On the grass","In a café","On a bench"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"'eat sandwiches on the grass'."}]},{"title":"My School Bag (התיק שלי)","text":"This is my school bag. It is blue. Inside I have three books, two pens and an apple. The bag is heavy, but I carry it every day.","glossary":[{"word":"bag","partOfSpeech":"noun","definition":"תיק לנשיאת דברים","example":"A school bag.","translation":"תיק"},{"word":"heavy","partOfSpeech":"adjective","definition":"כבד, קשה לשאת","example":"A heavy box.","translation":"כבד"},{"word":"carry","partOfSpeech":"verb","definition":"לשאת משהו","example":"I carry the bag.","translation":"לשאת"}],"questions":[{"question":"What colour is the bag?","options":["Red","Blue","Green","Black"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"'It is blue'."},{"question":"What fruit is in the bag?","options":["A banana","An apple","An orange","A pear"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"'an apple'."}]},{"title":"Rainy Day (יום גשום)","text":"Today it is raining. I cannot play outside. So I stay at home and draw pictures. My sister helps me. We have fun together, even on a rainy day.","glossary":[{"word":"raining","partOfSpeech":"verb","definition":"כשיורד גשם","example":"It is raining.","translation":"יורד גשם"},{"word":"outside","partOfSpeech":"adverb","definition":"מחוץ לבית","example":"Play outside.","translation":"בחוץ"},{"word":"draw","partOfSpeech":"verb","definition":"ליצור תמונה בעיפרון","example":"I draw a cat.","translation":"לצייר"}],"questions":[{"question":"Why can't the child play outside?","options":["It is night","It is raining","It is cold","It is late"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"'it is raining'."},{"question":"What do they do at home?","options":["Sleep","Draw pictures","Cook","Read"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"'draw pictures'."}]},{"title":"The Birthday (יום ההולדת)","text":"Today is my birthday. I am ten years old. My friends come to my house. We eat cake and play games. I am very happy.","glossary":[{"word":"birthday","partOfSpeech":"noun","definition":"יום ההולדת של אדם","example":"Happy birthday!","translation":"יום הולדת"},{"word":"cake","partOfSpeech":"noun","definition":"עוגה מתוקה","example":"A chocolate cake.","translation":"עוגה"},{"word":"happy","partOfSpeech":"adjective","definition":"שמח","example":"I am happy.","translation":"שמח"}],"questions":[{"question":"How old is the writer?","options":["Eight","Nine","Ten","Eleven"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"'I am ten years old'."},{"question":"What do they eat?","options":["Bread","Cake","Fruit","Soup"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"'We eat cake'."}]},{"title":"My Favourite Food (האוכל האהוב עליי)","text":"My favourite food is pizza. I eat it on Friday with my family. We make it at home. I put cheese and tomato on top. It is delicious!","glossary":[{"word":"favourite","partOfSpeech":"adjective","definition":"האהוב ביותר","example":"My favourite song.","translation":"אהוב/מועדף"},{"word":"cheese","partOfSpeech":"noun","definition":"מאכל מחלב","example":"I like cheese.","translation":"גבינה"},{"word":"top","partOfSpeech":"noun","definition":"החלק העליון","example":"On top.","translation":"למעלה/חלק עליון"}],"questions":[{"question":"What is the writer's favourite food?","options":["Pasta","Pizza","Rice","Soup"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"'My favourite food is pizza'."},{"question":"When do they eat it?","options":["Monday","Friday","Sunday","Every day"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"'on Friday'."}]},{"title":"Going to the Zoo (ביקור בגן החיות)","text":"On Sunday we go to the zoo. I see lions, monkeys and a big elephant. The monkeys are funny. My little brother likes the birds. We have a great day.","glossary":[{"word":"zoo","partOfSpeech":"noun","definition":"מקום עם חיות לצפייה","example":"We go to the zoo.","translation":"גן חיות"},{"word":"elephant","partOfSpeech":"noun","definition":"חיה גדולה מאוד","example":"A grey elephant.","translation":"פיל"},{"word":"funny","partOfSpeech":"adjective","definition":"מצחיק","example":"A funny story.","translation":"מצחיק"}],"questions":[{"question":"What animal does the brother like?","options":["Lions","Monkeys","Birds","Elephants"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"'my little brother likes the birds'."},{"question":"Which animal is described as big?","options":["The monkey","The elephant","The bird","The lion"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"'a big elephant'."}]}]